== Walkthrough ==

:''Main article: [[Incandescent Armor Quests]]''

He needs a Glowing Mask, found on the skeletal monk or the froglock scryer in the caverns of Guk and all three Runes of Fortune.  

One Rune can be found on the Dark Elf Enynti in the Chasm below Castle Mistmoore.  The other two can each be purchased for 50 golden coins each - one from Mizr N`Mar in the Neriak City Library and the other from Madam Serena in Qeynos. 

Purchasing the rune from Mizr N`Mar increases your faction with beta neutral,so this is an easy, but costly, way to raise this faction. 

Need all dialogues, /loc of quest mobs, drop information for each item, current faction hits if any.

